{"id":"ae4d761acfb9353d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-converse-well-founded.md","title":"Converse Well-Founded","display":"df-converse-well-founded — Converse Well-Founded","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-converse-well-founded","aliases":["89-df-converse-well-founded"],"display":"df-converse-well-founded — Converse Well-Founded","depends_on":["[[89-df-well-founded]]","[[89-df-accessibility]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-converse-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-converse-well-founded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-converse-well-founded — Converse Well-Founded"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9eaa23de86feec90\" href=\"?note=9eaa23de86feec90\" title=\"89-df-well-founded\">89-df-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(R\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}_{W}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}_{W}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9eaa23de86feec90\" href=\"?note=9eaa23de86feec90\" title=\"89-df-well-founded\">89-df-well-founded</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\\)</span> 是下述定义的逆良基性谓词，固定载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>，关系参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(R\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}converse\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR^{-1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in (W\\times W)\\mid vRw\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R^{-1}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}converse\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR^{-1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in (W\\times W)\\mid vRw\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R^{-1}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}_W(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}_W(R)\\)</span> : 固定载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 上的逆良基性</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{-1}\">\\(R^{-1}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>的逆关系</li>\n<li>GL 对应逆良基且传递的框架。逆良基采用非空子集存在无后继元素的集合论定义；与“无无限上升链”等价时使用相应选择原则。</li>\n<li>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 4 章，印刷页 74–77；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9eaa23de86feec90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-accessibility","status":"resolved","id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-2","ta